The mps-atlas-tess-quadratic-supplement.csv coefficients are derived from
CDS/VizieR catalog J/A+A/666/A60, tablee3, set 1, TESS passband:
https://cdsarc.u-strasbg.fr/viz-bin/cat/J/A+A/666/A60
Catalog DOI: https://doi.org/10.26093/cds/vizier.36660060

Kostogryz, N. M., et al. 2022, Astronomy & Astrophysics, 666, A60,
https://doi.org/10.1051/0004-6361/202243722, published by EDP Sciences.
The coefficients are interpolated and reduced from the original tabulated
center-to-limb intensities; they are not the authors' published coefficients.

CDS states that VizieR data are free for scientific use with explicit citation
